WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.877
All I do is hurt people.
So it's better if I don't do anything!

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:08.758
You'll get no pity from me. If you want
to avoid pain, just curl up and die.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.721
Crying now won't help!

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:20.228
You hate yourself, don't you?
That's why you hurt others.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:25.150
You know that hurting others
hurts you more than it hurts them.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:30.822
But no matter what lies ahead, it will be
the result of your own decisions.

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:34.743
That means something, Shinji!
It means you made a difference!

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:41.249
Don't lie to yourself, think about
what you can do, and make amends.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:46.796
You're just a stranger, Ms. Misato!
You don't know anything about me!

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:52.343
So what if I am a stranger?
You just want to give up?!

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:57.348
If you don't do anything now,
I'll never forgive you!

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:59.601
I'll never forgive you
for as long as I live!

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:02.395
You won't always be who you are now.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:07.859
You'll learn that you made mistakes
and regret them. That's me in a nutshell.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.696
A cycle of false elation
and self-loathing.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:15.033
But each time,
I made a little more progress.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:20.663
Listen, Shinji, pilot your Eva again
and figure things out.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.624
With the you who piloted the Eva.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:28.004
Why you came here.
What you were meant to do here.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.256
Figure out who you are now.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:36.304
And when you've worked it out,
make sure you come back.

00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:44.729
Promise me.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:47.315
Okay...

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:49.567
See you soon.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.584
That's how grown-ups kiss.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.963
There's more in store when you get back.

